# expect: srel targets row 0 member 1: relationship target -1 is reserved for functional no-link; use an empty fiber
# A set relationship spells no links as an empty fiber. -1 is the FUNCTIONAL sentinel and
# never a member, so it refuses rather than becoming a second silent convention.
n 3
col hp num 1 2 3
srel targets 0 -1 | 1 | 2
